==Quotes==
<!---Keep to a list of 5 quotes for general section and 2-3 for events--->
Here is a selection of {{PAGENAME}}'s dialogue lines.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* General <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter 12|quote= My brother is visiting soon. His daughter is adorable! She loves playing video games. I have a Super Neendo she plays when she visits. I don't play it myself. I'm too old for those electronic contraptions.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Winter, Monday, with 4 hearts|quote= Sautine City has beautiful shores and tourists from around the world. Every time I go there I meet someone whose life is completely different from mine. It's like a window into a different world. You should try traveling, [Farmer's Name]. Tickets can be expensive, but the experience is well worth it.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Summer, Friday, with 6 hearts|quote= It's a little silly, but I treat my houseplants like my family. You've probably noticed I'm pretty independent, [Farmer's Name]. But I do love my plants. When I travel, I miss them.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Sundays, with 10 hearts|quote=As you get older, time goes by faster and faster. Enjoy every moment of life. Don't take the time you have for granted, honey.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fall, Monday, with 10 hearts|quote= I like you because you understand that life should be an adventure, [Farmer's Name]. Some people might think that running a farm is boring, but you and I know that it takes so much time, patience, and creativity to do well. May our lives continue to be as rich as they have been so far, sweetie.}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* Events <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Events}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Fair|Fair]], even years|quote= Are you my competition, [Farmer's Name]? It'll be a close one, then! Experience versus the energy of youth.}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= [[Stardew:Ice Festival|Ice Festival]], odd years|quote= When I was younger, my father and I loved to fish together. Haven't fished at all since then. I think you'll do great in the contest, [Farmer's Name]. Best of luck to you, honey!}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title=[[Stardew:Feast of the Winter Star|Feast of the Winter Star]], even years|quote=Ahh, look at everyone with their rosy cheeks and their bright smiles. I'm glad I set myself up on my little farm here. And that you did on yours, honey.}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

